        "body": "## [0.3.0](https://github.com/yexiyue/SwarmNote/releases/tag/v0.3.0) - 2026-04-29\n\n### Documentation\n\n- rewrite README with bee-swarm theme and accurate stack\n- add CM6 migration tradeoffs analysis blog post\n- add uniffi-bindgen-react-native skill and blog guide\n### Features\n\n- **branding:** replace app icon and tray icons with new bee-and-S logo\n- **core:** expose doc_count on WorkspaceInfo\n- **core:** expose recent_workspaces CRUD on AppCore + auto-touch on open\n- **core:** re-export libp2p from swarm-p2p-core at crate root\n- **core:** re-export PeerId at crate root for wrap-layer consumers\n- **core:** complete swarmnote-core extraction via commands cut-over (phase 2 PR #3)\n- **core:** add WorkspaceCore + YDocManager + fs/document business layers (phase 2 PR #2)\n- add swarmnote-core crate for cross-platform extraction (phase 2 PR #1)\n- migrate desktop editor from BlockNote to CodeMirror 6\n### Miscellaneous\n\n- **libs:** bump swarm-p2p-core submodule (cargo fmt)\n- update editor submodule to c012e5f\n- integrate dev-workflow skill with project knowledge base\n- add @swarmnote/editor as git submodule\n### Refactor\n\n- **core:** flatten api/internal re-exports to single pub surface\n- **core:** harden swarmnote-core API for FFI wrapping\n- **sync:** split SyncManager into AppSyncCoordinator + WorkspaceSync\n- **yjs:** single-loop writeback driven by Notify + CancellationToken",
