        "body": "## [0.2.3](https://github.com/yexiyue/SwarmNote/releases/tag/v0.2.3) - 2026-04-08\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n- resolve TS2322 in Button asChild Slot.Root disabled prop\n- unify AppLayout and fix macOS editor scroll\n- sync dialog opens workspace in new window instead of binding to manager\n- subscribe already-open workspaces when P2P node starts\n- move GossipSub subscribe into bind_workspace_to_window\n- eliminate virtual window label in sync-only workspace registration\n- resolve clippy field_reassign_with_default in PairingManager\n- include device name in all pairing and share code flows\n- unify paired device data source and fix macOS window titlebar\n### Features\n\n- **pairing:** add toast feedback and OTP input for pairing flow\n- **sync:** hydrate yjs_state for all docs on workspace open\n- **sync:** add GossipSub ctrl topic for workspace open notifications\n- **ui:** add PeerListPopover to SyncStatusBar\n- refactor window architecture with Obsidian-style workspace manager\n- persist device name in DB and display in all pairing dialogs\n- propagate custom device name via P2P Identify protocol\n### Miscellaneous\n\n- update CSS theme to shadcn Nova defaults, sync Cargo.lock version\n### Refactor\n\n- **settings:** flatten general and sync pages to section-based layout\n- **settings:** replace custom UI with shadcn components, reset to default theme\n- **settings/about:** redesign about page to match design spec\n- **settings/devices:** redesign device management page per design spec",
