      {
        "version": "0.2.1",
        "tagName": "v0.2.1",
        "name": "SwarmNote v0.2.1",
        "publishedAt": "2026-04-05T03:43:25Z",
        "body": "## [0.2.1](https://github.com/yexiyue/SwarmNote/releases/tag/v0.2.1) - 2026-04-05\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n- **build:** correct App.css import casing for case-sensitive filesystems\n- **db:** invoke before_save manually for Entity::insert() upsert paths\n- **db:** enforce UUID integrity with UNIQUE constraint and lifecycle fixes\n- **editor:** fix title isDirty not clearing and case-sensitive .md check\n- **frontend:** simplify code and fix placeholder issues\n- **i18n:** 补全前端各组件的国际化覆盖\n- **i18n:** remove compiled catalogs and fix setLocale race condition\n- **identity:** suppress dead_code warning for keypair field\n- **network:** activate event listeners and unify node status architecture\n- **pairing:** multiple pairing logic bugs\n- **pairing:** pass remote osInfo in code pairing to store correct device info\n- **pairing:** pass notificationId as prop to prevent dialog close failure\n- **pairing:** update CommandPalette to use openSettingsWindow\n- **release:** bump version to 0.2.1 and align plugin-updater versions\n- **sync:** ensure workspace topic subscription and asset sync for closed docs\n- **sync:** use tuple variant directly to satisfy clippy::redundant_closure\n- **sync:** use sort_by_key to fix clippy::unnecessary_sort_by\n- **updater:** add missing plugin deps and remove unused version prop\n- **workspace:** suppress unused variable warning for settings_window on non-macOS\n- **workspace:** 修复工作区打开流程及编辑器块类型\n- **yrs-blocknote:** preserve list spread state through markdown round-trip\n### CI/CD\n\n- add submodule checkout and libdbus for keyring\n### Documentation\n\n- **design:** complete settings page redesign with all 4 tabs\n- **design:** add v0.2.0 pairing and sync UI designs\n- **milestone:** add v0.2.1 remaining issues todo list\n- **milestone:** add design decisions for workspace-ignore-filter\n- **milestone:** update v0.2.0 with device pairing, UI design, and full network support\n- **sync:** add CRDT sync architecture and asset sync design documents\n- resolve blog post conflict after amend (keep updated version)\n- add yrs-blocknote deep-dive blog post\n- add yrs-blocknote deep-dive blog post\n- backfill v0.2.1 issue numbers and milestone link\n- add device connection type feature for v0.2.1\n- add v0.2.1 milestone - sync UX polish & auto-update\n- add P2P sync deep-dive and update CLAUDE.md\n- add sidebar layout and settings window UI optimization spec\n- add TauriYjsProvider blog post and external-file-sync feature spec\n- add v0.2.0 milestone planning and commit conventions\n- add device identity technical design\n- update v0.1.0 docs to reflect new UI design decisions\n- redesign v0.1.0 UI with indigo theme and desktop-only layout\n- add UI design draft\n- use Project Iteration for Sprint, not Milestone\n- use Tasklist format for issue dependency tracking\n- integrate GitHub Projects into project skills\n- backfill GitHub Issue numbers to v0.1.0 README\n- add next-step hint to project-explore skill\n- add v0.1.0 milestone docs and enhance project skills\n- add UI design requirements, remove comment system from design docs\n- add system design docs, simplify to 3-level permissions\n- replace CodeMirror with BlockNote, remove yrs dependency\n- add BlockNote research, update editor choice from CodeMirror to BlockNote\n- rewrite README in Chinese with project overview\n- simplify dev-notes, extract E2E encryption design\n- redesign product vision, add swarm-p2p submodule, reorganize dev-notes\n### Features\n\n- **ci:** add release workflow with auto-update signing config\n- **db:** implement SQLite storage layer with sea-orm 2.0-rc\n- **device:** add connection type identification (LAN/DCUtR/Relay)\n- **editor:** add media loading retry with skeleton UI for P2P asset sync\n- **editor:** integrate BlockNote rich-text editor with markdown persistence\n- **filetree:** implement filesystem-driven file tree with CRUD and live watching\n- **i18n:** complete i18n for settings nav, network status, and device components\n- **i18n:** add Lingui internationalization with zh/en support\n- **i18n:** add Lingui internationalization with zh/en support\n- **identity:** implement device identity with system keychain\n- **p2p:** system tray, P2P lifecycle control, and Rust code quality refactor\n- **p2p:** auto-start P2P node on app launch\n- **p2p:** integrate swarm-p2p-core into Tauri backend (#24)\n- **pairing:** implement device discovery and pairing (#26)\n- **settings:** reorganize settings tabs - add sync tab, remove network tab\n- **skill:** add project-issue skill for quick issue creation\n- **storage:** implement markdown persistence with media support\n- **store:** add Zustand stores with tauri-plugin-store persistence\n- **sync:** switch GossipSub from per-doc to workspace-level topics\n- **sync:** implement CRDT sync engine with full/incremental sync and asset transfer\n- **sync:** detect external .md changes and reload Y.Doc automatically\n- **sync-ui:** improve sync dialog with progress bar, re-sync support, and clickable results\n- **ui:** implement UI framework with shadcn/ui + Tailwind v4 + TanStack Router\n- **ui:** implement UI framework with shadcn/ui + Tailwind v4 + TanStack Router\n- **updater:** integrate tauri-plugin-updater for desktop auto-update\n- **workspace:** workspace list exchange API and UUID-first state (#46)\n- **workspace:** implement workspace lifecycle management\n- **yjs:** integrate BlockNote collaboration mode with Rust YDocManager\n- **yrs-blocknote:** align Block data model with BlockNote format\n- **yrs-blocknote:** add independent crate for BlockNote ↔ Markdown ↔ Y.Doc conversion\n- v0.2.1 sync UI — sidebar status, workspace picker sync, onboarding P2P flow (#45, #50, #49)\n- add mdast-util-to-markdown crate (Rust port of JS library)\n- integrate BlockNote editor and redesign settings UI (#39)\n- add onboarding flow, workspace picker, and per-window state management\n- remove android\n- add GitHub project management skills and guide\n- init\n### Miscellaneous\n\n- **i18n:** merge auto-update and workspace-sync i18n entries\n- **i18n:** sync zh catalog after lingui extract\n- add **/target/** to .gitignore for workspace crates\n- update swarm-p2p submodule to develop (gossipsub integration)\n- integrate dev toolchain (biome, lefthook, commitlint, git-cliff, CI)\n### Refactor\n\n- **backend:** restructure Rust modules by business domain\n- **db:** stabilize document and workspace UUIDs for sync readiness\n- **entity:** migrate time fields from i64 to chrono::DateTime<Utc>\n- **entity:** use Uuid type instead of String for primary keys and foreign keys\n- **rust:** split event_loop and encapsulate GlobalConfigState\n- **sync:** reduce SV compensation frequency and add publish-failure trigger\n- **ui:** 将工作区切换和快捷操作移至标题栏\n- **ui:** extract shared components and hooks to reduce duplication\n- **ui:** 将设置页面从独立路由改为弹窗 (#20)\n- **yrs-blocknote:** replace comrak with markdown + mdast-util-to-markdown\n### Testing\n\n- **yrs-blocknote:** add BlockNote compat tests and batch real doc tests",
